6-03-25-thoughts-on-slowing-the-fuck-down/\" class=\"flex gap-4 items-center\">\n                <div class=\"flex row gap-4 items-baseline\">\n                    <span class=\"text-sm text-muted italic whitespace-nowrap\">2026-03-25</span>\n                    <span>Thoughts on slowing the fuck down</span>\n                </div>\n            </a>\n        \n            <a href=\"/posts/2025-12-22-year-in-review-2025/\" class=\"flex gap-4 items-center\">\n                <div class=\"flex row gap-4 items-baseline\">\n                    <span class=\"text-sm text-muted italic whitespace-nowrap\">2025-12-22</span>\n                    <span>Year in Review 2025</span>\n                </div>\n            </a>\n        \n            <a href=\"/posts/2025-11-30-pi-coding-agent/\" class=\"flex gap-4 items-center\">\n                <div class=\"flex row gap-4 items-baseline\">\n                    <span class=\"text-sm text-muted italic whitespace-nowrap\">2025-11-30</span>\n                    <span>What I learned building an opinionated and minimal coding agent</span>\n                </div>\n            </a>\n        \n            <a href=\"/posts/2025-11-22-armin-is-wrong/\" class=\"flex gap-4 items-center\">\n                <div class=\"flex row gap-4 items-baseline\">\n                    <span class=\"text-sm text-muted italic whitespace-nowrap\">2025-11-22</span>\n                    <span>Armin is wrong and here's why</span>\n                </div>\n            </a>\n        \n            <a href=\"/posts/2025-11-02-what-if-you-dont-need-mcp/\" class=\"flex gap-4 items-center\">\n                <div class=\"flex row gap-4 items-baseline\">\n                    <span class=\"text-sm text-muted italic whitespace-nowrap\">2025-11-02</span>\n                    <span>What if you don't need MCP at all?</span>\n                </div>\n            </a>\n        \n            <a href=\"/posts/2025-10-05-jailjs/\" class=\"flex gap-4 items-center\">\n                <div class=\"flex row gap-4 items-baseline\">\n                    <span class=\"text-sm text-muted italic whitespace-nowrap\">2025-10-05</span>\n                    <span>Infinite Footguns: Writing a JavaScript Interpreter in JavaScript</span>\n                </div>\n            </a>\n        \n            <a href=\"/posts/2025-08-15-mcp-vs-cli/\" class=\"flex gap-4 items-center\">\n                <div class=\"flex row gap-4 items-baseline\">\n                    <span class=\"text-sm text-muted italic whitespace-nowrap\">2025-08-15</span>\n                    <span>MCP vs CLI: Benchmarking Tools for Coding Agents</span>\n                </div>\n            </a>\n        \n            <a href=\"/posts/2025-08-06-cc-antidebug/\" class=\"flex gap-4 items-center\">\n                <div class=\"flex row gap-4 items-baseline\">\n                    <span class=\"text-sm text-muted italic whitespace-nowrap\">2025-08-06</span>\n                    <span>Patching Claude Code for debugging and /cost support for Max users</span>\n                </div>\n            </a>\n        \n            <a href=\"/posts/2025-08-03-cchistory/\" class=\"flex gap-4 items-center\">\n                <div class=\"flex row gap-4 items-baseline\">\n                    <span class=\"text-sm text-muted italic whitespace-nowrap\">2025-08-03</span>\n                    <span>cchistory: Tracking Claude Code System Prompt and Tool Changes</span>\n                </div>\n            </a>\n        \n            <a href=\"/posts/2025-06-02-prompts-are-code/\" class=\"flex gap-4 items-center\">\n                <div class=\"flex row gap-4 items-baseline\">\n                    <span class=\"text-sm text-muted italic whitespace-nowrap\">2025-06-02</span>\n                    <span>Prompts are code, .json/.md files are state</span>\n                </div>\n            </a>\n        \n            <a href=\"/posts/2025-04-20-boxie/\" class=\"flex gap-4 items-center\">\n                <div class=\"flex row gap-4 items-baseline\">\n                    <span class=\"text-sm text-muted italic whitespace-nowrap\">2025-04-26</span>\n                    <span>Boxie - an always offline audio player for my 3 year old</span>\n                </div>\n            </a>\n        \n            <a href=\"/posts/2024-08-22-electronic-nights-3/\" class=\"flex gap-4 items-center\">\n                <div class=\"flex row gap-4 items-baseline\">\n                    <span class=\"text-sm text-muted italic whitespace-nowrap\">2024-08-22</span>\n                    <span>Electronic Nights III - Animated LEDs and Buttons</span>\n                </div>\n            </a>\n        \n            <a href=\"/posts/2024-08-05-electronic-nights-2/\" class=\"flex gap-4 items-center\">\n                <div class=\"flex row gap-4 items-baseline\">\n                    <span class=\"text-sm text-muted italic whitespace-nowrap\">2024-08-05</span>\n                    <span>Electronic Nights II - Basic Circuits</span>\n                </div>\n            </a>\n        \n            <a href=\"/posts/2024-07-25-electronic-nights-1/\" class=\"flex gap-4 items-center\">\n                <div class=\"flex row gap-4 items-baseline\">\n                    <span class=\"text-sm text-muted italic whitespace-nowrap\">2024-07-26</span>\n                    <span>Electronic Nights I - Getting Started</span>\n                </div>\n            </a>\n        \n            <a href=\"/posts/2024-07-20-macos-code-injection-fun/\" class=\"flex gap-4 items-center\">\n                <div class=\"flex row gap-4 items-baseline\">\n                    <span class=\"text-sm text-muted italic whitespace-nowrap\">2024-07-20</span>\n                    <span>macOS code injection for fun and no profit</span>\n                </div>\n            </a>\n        \n            <a href=\"/posts/2024-07-15-two-years-in-review/\" class=\"flex gap-4 items-center\">\n                <div class=\"flex row gap-4 items-baseline\">\n                    <span class=\"text-sm text-muted italic whitespace-nowrap\">2024-07-15</span>\n                    <span>Two years in review</span>\n                </div>\n            </a>\n        \n            <a href=\"/posts/2024-07-14-dissecting-history/\" class=\"flex gap-4 items-center\">\n                <div class=\"flex row gap-4 items-baseline\">\n                    <span class=\"text-sm text-muted italic whitespace-nowrap\">2024-07-14</span>\n                    <span>Dissecting history</span>\n                </div>\n            </a>\n        \n    </div>\n\n    <h4 class=\"mb-6\">Recommended reading/viewing <a href=\"/recommended-reading/rss.xml\" class=\"text-sm\" aria-label=\"RSS feed\"><svg style=\"width: 18px; color: var(--link-color);\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rss-icon lucide-rss\"><path d=\"M4 11a9 9 0 0 1 9 9\"></path><path d=\"M4 4a16 16 0 0 1 16 16\"></path><circle cx=\"5\" cy=\"19\" r=\"1\"></circle></svg></a></h4>\n    <div id=\"latest-recommendations\" class=\"post-list flex flex-col gap-4\">\n                        <a href=\"https://dank.systems/posts/2026-09-15-ai-bear.html\" class=\"flex gap-4 items-center\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                            <div class=\"flex row gap-4 items-baseline\">\n                                <span class=\"text-sm text-muted italic whitespace-nowrap\">2026-09-16</span>\n                                <span>why i'm still bearish on LLMs after navier-stokes | jay kruer</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </a>\n                    \n                        <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?is=cwikvYMXwQ_4zGA6&amp;v=svl_1upFpQo&amp;feature=youtu.be\" class=\"flex gap-4 items-center\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                            <div class=\"flex row gap-4 items-baseline\">\n                                <span class=\"text-sm text-muted italic whitespace-nowrap\">2026-09-16</span>\n                                <span>The paradox at the heart of AI and science | Terence Tao</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </a>\n                    \n                        <a href=\"https://lucumr.pocoo.org/2026/9/14/interpreting-pangram/\" class=\"flex gap-4 items-center\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                            <div class=\"flex row gap-4 items-baseline\">\n                                <span class=\"text-sm text-muted italic whitespace-nowrap\">2026-09-15</span>\n                                <span>Interpreting Pangram</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </a>\n                    \n                        <a href=\"https://lucumr.pocoo.org/2026/9/12/pdoom/\" class=\"flex gap-4 items-center\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                            <div class=\"flex row gap-4 items-baseline\">\n                                <span class=\"text-sm text-muted italic whitespace-nowrap\">2026-09-15</span>\n                                <span>P(doom)</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </a>\n                    \n                        <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9UAxrdcDjjU\" class=\"flex gap-4 items-center\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n                            <div class=\"flex row gap-4 items-baseline\">\n                                <span class=\"text-sm text-muted italic whitespace-nowrap\">2026-09-10</span>\n                                <span>State of Agentic Coding #10 with Armin and Ben</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n    <p class=\"mt-4\"><a href=\"/recommended-reading/\" class=\"featured-link\">More recommended reading/viewing →</a></p>\n\n    <h4 class=\"mt-8 mb-6\">Who I am</h4>\n    <p>\n        I'm an independent software developer, coach, and angel investor with over 15 years of experience in academia\n        <q-l href=\"https://scholar.google.at/citations?user=6hFnJ00AAAAJ&amp;hl=en\" style=\"display: inline-flex;\">\n        <a href=\"https://scholar.google.at/citations?user=6hFnJ00AAAAJ&amp;hl=en\" class=\"inline-flex items-baseline\" style=\"color: var(--link-color); font-size: 12px; transform: translateY(-6px);\">\n          <span>[</span>\n          <i class=\"icon\" style=\"width: 12px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M19.4167 6.67891C20.4469 7.77257 21.0001 9 21.0001 10.9897C21.0001 14.4891 18.5436 17.6263 14.9695 19.1768L14.0768 17.7992C17.4121 15.9946 18.0639 13.6539 18.3245 12.178C17.7875 12.4557 17.0845 12.5533 16.3954 12.4895C14.591 12.3222 13.1689 10.8409 13.1689 9C13.1689 7.067 14.7359 5.5 16.6689 5.5C17.742 5.5 18.7681 5.99045 19.4167 6.67891ZM9.41669 6.67891C10.4469 7.77257 11.0001 9 11.0001 10.9897C11.0001 14.4891 8.54359 17.6263 4.96951 19.1768L4.07682 17.7992C7.41206 15.9946 8.06392 13.6539 8.32447 12.178C7.78747 12.4557 7.08452 12.5533 6.39539 12.4895C4.59102 12.3222 3.16895 10.8409 3.16895 9C3.16895 7.067 4.73595 5.5 6.66895 5.5C7.742 5.5 8.76814 5.99045 9.41669 6.67891Z\"></path></svg></i>\n          <span>]</span>\n        </a>\n      </q-l>, startups\n        <q-l href=\"https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20151021005382/en/Xamarin-Acquires-RoboVM-Now-the-Only-Cross-Platform-Mobile-Development-Company-for-the-Top-Two-Enterprise-Languages\" style=\"display: inline-flex;\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20151021005382/en/Xamarin-Acquires-RoboVM-Now-the-Only-Cross-Platform-Mobile-Development-Company-for-the-Top-Two-Enterprise-Languages\" class=\"inline-flex items-baseline\" style=\"color: var(--link-color); font-size: 12px; transform: translateY(-6px);\